== Overview ==
The Frost Skeleton Toilet is the final boss of [[Christmas Mode]]. It only appears at Wave 50 and has a high health of 3,340,000. It makes a comeback in  [[Endless Mode]] as a Wave 60 boss. 

The Frost Skeleton has 2 abilities. It's first ability is that it can use its hammer to attack a unit, freezing it. It can also spawn ice which will fall on a unit and freeze it. As it freezes units, they cannot be unstunned by [[Medic Cameraman]], [[Camera Repair Drone]] or [[Speaker Repair Drone]]
==Appearance==
The Frost Skeleton Toilet looks like a mutant toilet with a blue theme and four claw legs. It has neon blue parts on its chest with white eyes and blue horns. It also has a blue, squarish hammer which is used to stun units. 
==Waves==
===Christmas Mode===
*Wave 50: 3,340,000 HP (x1)
=== Endless Mode ===
Wave 60: 12,927,262 HP (1x)

==Abiltities==
*Hammer Smash: Smashes its hammer against a unit, stunning it.
*Ice Spikes: Spawn multiple ice spikes above an unit, stunning it.
==Strategy==

* Use high DPS units such as the [[Upgraded Titan Cameraman]], [[Sinister Titan TV Man]], [[Hyper Upgraded Titan Speakerman|﻿​​​﻿Hyper Upgraded Titan Speakerman]], ﻿​​​﻿[[Titan Firework Man]],[[Golden Future Large Clockman|﻿​​​﻿Golden Future Large Clockman]], or [[Upgraded Titan Cinemaman]].
* You can also use non-stunning units like some [[Ultimate|Ultimates]] or if you need something cheaper, Upgraded large laser cameraman at max level as that can't egt stunned at max and has pretty high dps.

==Trivia==
*The Frost Skeleton Toilet has a resemblance to the [[Mutant Pumpkin Toilet]].
*It's right arm is longer than it's left arm for some reason. I wonder why...

